@startuml
title Docker Compose 默认栈部署图（AI-辅助）
top to bottom direction
node "浏览器 / 烟测客户端" as client
cloud "可选 AI 服务\nDeepSeek API" as vision
node "Docker Compose 主机\nWindows Docker Desktop 或 Ubuntu VM" as host {
  node "frontend 容器\nNginx :80（宿主 :8080）" as frontend {
    artifact "Vue 构建产物" as dist
  }
  node "gateway 容器\nJava 21 :18080" as gateway {
    artifact "gateway.jar" as gatewayJar
  }
  node "space-service 容器\nJava 21 :18081" as space {
    artifact "space-service.jar" as spaceJar
  }
  node "access-service 容器\nJava 21 :18082" as access {
    artifact "access-service.jar" as accessJar
  }
  node "billing-service 容器\nJava 21 :18083" as billing {
    artifact "billing-service.jar" as billingJar
  }
  node "pass-service 容器\nJava 21 :18084" as pass {
    artifact "pass-service.jar" as passJar
  }
  node "analytics-service 容器\nJava 21 :18085" as analytics {
    artifact "analytics-service.jar" as analyticsJar
  }
  node "mysql 容器\nMySQL 8.4 :3306" as mysql {
    database "parking_space" as dbSpace
    database "parking_access" as dbAccess
    database "parking_billing" as dbBilling
    database "parking_pass" as dbPass
    database "parking_analytics" as dbAnalytics
  }
  node "redis 容器\nRedis :6379" as redis
}
client --> frontend : HTTP :8080
client --> gateway : HTTP :18080
frontend --> gateway : /api/ 反向代理
gateway --> space : HTTP 固定地址
gateway --> access : HTTP 固定地址
gateway --> billing : HTTP 固定地址
gateway --> pass : HTTP 固定地址
gateway --> analytics : HTTP 固定地址
space --> dbSpace : JDBC / 专属账号
access --> dbAccess : JDBC / 专属账号
billing --> dbBilling : JDBC / 专属账号
pass --> dbPass : JDBC / 专属账号
analytics --> dbAnalytics : JDBC / 专属账号
analytics ..> redis : 已保存报表缓存；故障回源 MySQL
access ..> vision : 可选图片识别/出行建议 HTTPS；不写权威状态
analytics ..> vision : 启用报表解读时 HTTPS；仅汇总数据
@enduml
